{"pageid":4078,"title":"Acid Smog","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Acid Smog</span>","revid":21361,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Acid Smog</b> is a medium-sized cave within the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a> caves. To find it, go left from the Acidlands entrance until you get into a cave. There, you can find a hole that goes down into the smog.\n</p><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Acid Smog</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4a/AcidSmog.png/revision/latest?cb=20250524072055\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"AcidSmog\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4a/AcidSmog.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250524072055\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4a/AcidSmog.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250524072055 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4a/AcidSmog.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250524072055 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"AcidSmog\" width=\"270\" height=\"143\" data-image-key=\"AcidSmog.png\" data-image-name=\"AcidSmog.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Acidlands</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"NPC\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">NPC</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ores, NPC combat</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>This region is characterized by a very dark, choking atmosphere that constantly deals damage to players. The terrain consists of a few islands or juts from the surrounding walls, most of which containing large pillars and green crystals similar to those seen in the <a href=\"/wiki/Boomite\" title=\"Boomite\">Boomite</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Quartz_Cave\" title=\"Quartz Cave\">Quartz caves</a>, along with skeletons of some distant leviathan creatures. It has two entrances, both of which are in the Acid caves, and both are on the north/back of the island. Many of the acid rivers within the caves flow into the lakes in this biome, very slightly visible from the upper levels of the acid caves. 3 hostile NPCs can be found here; the normal Skeletons, armored skeletons, and goblin dogs. One of the key differences between the Acid Smog and the rest of the island is the unusually high spawn rate of <a href=\"/wiki/Uranium\" title=\"Uranium\">Uranium,</a> commonly being the majority of all ore nodes that spawn, and the lack of <a href=\"/wiki/Greeb\" title=\"Greeb\">Greeb</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Inkstone\" title=\"Inkstone\">Ink</a> nodes. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Strategy\">Strategy</span></h2>\n<p>The Acid Smog features a toxic, dense gas that constantly deals damage to anyone inside. Because of this, and the hostile NPCs, a <a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Coil\" title=\"Healing Coil\">healing coil</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">fusion coil</a> is absolutely required to survive in this biome. Mining ores is challenging, as anything short of an <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertain_Pickaxe\" title=\"Uncertain Pickaxe\">Uncertain Pickaxe</a> deals such low damage, or such a small radius, that mining one node could take several minutes. Navigating this region is also difficult without <a href=\"/wiki/Night_Vision_Goggles\" title=\"Night Vision Goggles\">night vision</a> or a <a href=\"/wiki/Flashlight\" title=\"Flashlight\">flashlight</a>, as there is almost no light within this region and multiple bridges over extremely deadly acid rivers. Should the player survive long enough to get a few trailers of ore, however, and manage to forge the uranium, they can expect to bring in well over $100,000 from one mining trip in just this part of the Acid Lands, if not $2-300,000.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903010832\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 59/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019435/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   24.851      1 Template:Buildings\n100.00%   24.851      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4078-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903010832 and revision id 21361. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Acidlands","exists":true},{"title":"Boomite","exists":true},{"title":"Flashlight","exists":true},{"title":"Fusion Coil","exists":true},{"title":"Greeb","exists":true},{"title":"Healing Coil","exists":true},{"title":"Inkstone","exists":true},{"title":"Night Vision Goggles","exists":true},{"title":"Quartz Cave","exists":true},{"title":"Uncertain Pickaxe","exists":true},{"title":"Uranium","exists":true}],"images":["AcidSmog.png"]}
